00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:10.949
Speaker 8: Well, since I specialize in foundations
of physics, the one you mentioned, like, how

00:08:10.949 --> 00:08:15.080
is there a beginning to the entire universe
cosmos?

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:16.780
And if so, what was it like?

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:21.319
And could there be anything that we would
count as an explanation for why it was like

00:08:21.319 --> 00:08:22.319
