00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:16.670
You say you enemies.

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:18.900
You have to prove your case beyond any doubt.

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:21.110
And me, I can just say whatever I want.

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:25.410
Speaker 1: So it's a question of burden, of
proof in a sense.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:30.959
Speaker 8: So, you know, solipsism, I mean,
the view that only I exist, I think has literally

00:11:30.959 --> 00:11:33.410
nothing to say for.

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:34.880
Of course, there are things other than me.

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:35.880
There are tables and chairs.

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:39.690
And if I leave the room, as HUME would say,
if I leave the room and the fire is burning

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:41.800
and I come back later, it's a bunch of ashes.

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:42.800
Why?

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:45.870
Because it kept burning all the time when
I wasn't there.

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:48.400
I mean, that's the obvious explanation.

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:52.589
It's not you know, you can say, I could make
up, maybe I'm in the Matrix, maybe there's

00:11:52.589 --> 00:11:53.800
some ETS.

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:55.020
You can always make up stuff.

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:57.519
Yes, but there's no reason to believe the
