00:11:57.519 --> 00:11:59.680
And there's the whole picture we have.

00:11:59.680 --> 00:12:05.520
The physical universe hangs together and allows
you to make predictions and explain a lot

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:09.370
of stuff that requires there to be more than
just me.

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:15.709
So I would say all the evidence is in favor
of it not being just me and none of the evidence.

00:12:15.709 --> 00:12:17.589
Now, it's not an absolute proof.

00:12:17.589 --> 00:12:21.449
Okay, so you're just asking too much for an
absolute proof.

00:12:21.449 --> 00:12:23.690
Reasonable people don't demand absolute proof.

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:27.709
They they adjust their beliefs to where the
weight of the evidence is.

00:12:27.709 --> 00:12:33.079
Speaker 1: With many of these questions, I've
asked folks like Lawrence Krauss, for example,

00:12:33.079 --> 00:12:39.330
