00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:40.120
survive.

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:41.260
How far will they take us?

00:13:41.260 --> 00:13:44.590
Will they take us to an end, as it were? Theory.

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:47.970
That's just the right theory that always makes
