00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:49.390
Or will we get stuck?

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:50.390
I don't know.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:52.990
I mean, the only way to find out is to push
forward, right?

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:58.870
The only way to find out is to figure out
what we don't know now and investigate the

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:04.660
possible ways to go forward and push as hard
as you can to make a prediction about whether

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:06.590
we'll succeed or not.

00:14:06.590 --> 00:14:11.889
I you know, I guess I tend to be kind of optimistic,
but I but that's just a character trait of

00:14:11.889 --> 00:14:12.889
mine.

00:14:12.889 --> 00:14:13.889
That's not an argument.

00:14:13.889 --> 00:14:19.779
